// NOT THE LIVE RULES. Do not deploy from this file.
//
// The live Cloud Firestore security rules are managed in the Firebase console
// (project ghareeb-fencing). They were last released Sep 16, 2026 and
// require a named owner/office staff account (the 'staff' collection,
// fullExecutive()) for all business data, and the site owner's verified
// Google account for website content.
//
// An older copy here allowed any signed-in user, including anonymous
// sessions, to read and write almost everything. It was replaced with this
// note on Nov 15, 2026 so it can never be deployed by accident. This file
// is intentionally not valid rules syntax, so 'firebase deploy' fails
// instead of overwriting the live rules.
